        "headline": "雙十連假離島管制航線將於下週一開放訂位",
        "summary": "台灣交通部民用航空局宣布，2026年雙十節3天連假期間，澎湖、金門及馬祖三離島管制航線將提供1,102架次、共計89,926個座位數。相關機票將於8月10日上午9時起統一開放訂位。本次航空疏運期自10月8日至10月12日，為期5天，尖峰時段管制航線機票將加註使用限制。",
        "headline_en": "Taiwan to Open Bookings for Double Tenth Holiday Flights to Offshore Islands on August 10",
        "summary_en": "Taiwan's Civil Aeronautics Administration announced that bookings for flights to Penghu, Kinmen, and Matsu during the 2026 Double Tenth Day holiday will open on August 10 at 9:00 AM. The air transportation period will run from October 8 to October 12, offering 1,102 flights and 89,926 seats. To ensure efficient travel during peak hours, tickets for these island routes will include specific restrictions, such as being valid only on the scheduled day and flight.",
