        "headline": "國防部偵獲中共19機艦船活動 6架次共機逾越中線",
        "summary": "國防部表示，自8月6日上午6時至8月7日上午6時止，共偵獲中共機艦船合計19單位在台海周邊活動，包含中共軍機10架次、軍艦6艘及公務船3艘。其中有6架次軍機逾越海峽中線，進入台灣中部及西南空域。國軍運用任務機艦與岸置飛彈系統進行嚴密監控與應處。",
        "headline_en": "Taiwan Detects 19 PLA Aircraft and Vessels as 6 Sorties Cross Median Line",
        "summary_en": "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense announced that 19 Chinese military aircraft, naval vessels, and official ships were detected operating around the Taiwan Strait between 06:00 on August 6 and 06:00 on August 7. The recorded sorties included 10 PLA aircraft, 6 PLA Navy vessels, and 3 official ships. Among the detected aircraft, 6 sorties crossed the median line of the Taiwan Strait, entering central and southwestern airspace. Taiwan's armed forces monitored the activities and responded using combat air patrol aircraft, naval vessels, and land-based missile systems.",
